{"seq":2,"slug":"snapshot-testing","title":"快照测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-architecture/testing-architecture/snapshot-testing","wordCount":668,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"快照测试\">快照测试</h1><p>快照测试（Snapshot Testing）通过对比 UI 渲染结果的图片来检测视觉回归。本文介绍 SnapshotTesting 库的使用、多设备/特征录制、CI 环境中的差异对比以及更新策略。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>快照测试把「渲染结果」当作期待值记录下来，用图片比对检测视觉回归，围绕以下概念展开：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>快照原理</strong>：渲染视图并截图，与参考图比对，不一致即判定回归</li>\n<li><strong>多设备/特征录制</strong>：在不同屏幕尺寸、动态字体、深浅色等条件下分别录制</li>\n<li><strong>CI 环境差异</strong>：不同机器渲染结果可能有细微差异，需要对齐环境</li>\n<li><strong>更新策略</strong>：有意变更 UI 时重新录制参考图，而非盲目接受差异</li>\n</ul>\n<p>关键在于<strong>参考图的更新是刻意行为</strong>：只有在确认视觉变更是预期的时候才更新，否则快照就失去把关意义。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"快照测试原理\">快照测试原理</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    View[&quot;渲染视图&quot;] --&gt; Capture[&quot;截取图片&quot;]&#10;    Capture --&gt; Check{&quot;参考图存在?&quot;}&#10;    Check --&gt;|否| Save[&quot;保存为参考图&quot;]&#10;    Check --&gt;|是| Compare[&quot;像素对比&quot;]&#10;    Compare --&gt; Match{&quot;匹配?&quot;}&#10;    Match --&gt;|是| Pass[&quot;测试通过 ✅&quot;]&#10;    Match --&gt;|否| Fail[&quot;测试失败 ❌ + 差异图&quot;]&#10;&#10;    classDef process fill:none,stroke:#2196F3&#10;    classDef decision fill:none,stroke:#FF9800&#10;    classDef result fill:none,stroke:#4CAF50&#10;&#10;    class View,Capture,Save,Compare process&#10;    class Check,Match decision&#10;    class Pass,Fail result\">graph LR\n    View[\"渲染视图\"] --&gt; Capture[\"截取图片\"]\n    Capture --&gt; Check{\"参考图存在?\"}\n    Check --&gt;|否| Save[\"保存为参考图\"]\n    Check --&gt;|是| Compare[\"像素对比\"]\n    Compare --&gt; Match{\"匹配?\"}\n    Match --&gt;|是| Pass[\"测试通过 ✅\"]\n    Match --&gt;|否| Fail[\"测试失败 ❌ + 差异图\"]\n\n    classDef process fill:none,stroke:#2196F3\n    classDef decision fill:none,stroke:#FF9800\n    classDef result fill:none,stroke:#4CAF50\n\n    class View,Capture,Save,Compare process\n    class Check,Match decision\n    class Pass,Fail result</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"snapshottesting-库\">SnapshotTesting 库</h2><p>Point-Free 的 SnapshotTesting 是 Swift 社区最流行的快照测试库：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// Package.swift 依赖&#10;// .package(url: &quot;https://github.com/pointfreeco/swift-snapshot-testing&quot;, from: &quot;1.15.0&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Package.swift 依赖</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// .package(url: \"https://github.com/pointfreeco/swift-snapshot-testing\", from: \"1.15.0\")</span></span></code></pre></div><p>基本使用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"import XCTest&#10;import SnapshotTesting&#10;import SwiftUI&#10;&#10;final class ProductCardSnapshotTests: XCTestCase {&#10;    func testProductCardDefault() {&#10;        let view = ProductCardView(&#10;            product: Product(&#10;                id: &quot;1&quot;,&#10;                name: &quot;iPhone 16 Pro&quot;,&#10;                price: 8999,&#10;                imageURL: nil,&#10;                rating: 4.8&#10;            )&#10;        )&#10;&#10;        let hostingController = UIHostingController(rootView: view)&#10;        hostingController.view.frame = CGRect(x: 0, y: 0, width: 375, height: 200)&#10;&#10;        assertSnapshot(of: hostingController, as: .image)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    func testProductCardSoldOut() {&#10;        let view = ProductCardView(&#10;            product: Product(&#10;                id: &quot;2&quot;,&#10;                name: &quot;AirPods Pro&quot;,&#10;                price: 1899,&#10;                imageURL: nil,&#10;                rating: 4.5,&#10;                isSoldOut: true&#10;            )&#10;        )&#10;&#10;        let hostingController = UIHostingController(rootView: view)&#10;        hostingController.view.frame = CGRect(x: 0, y: 0, width: 375, height: 200)&#10;&#10;        assertSnapshot(of: hostingController, as: .image)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> XCTest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SnapshotTesting</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SwiftUI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">final</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProductCardSnapshotTests</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">XCTestCase </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> testProductCardDefault</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> view </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ProductCardView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            product</sp